  "foaf:name": "Oceanographic and Ecological data for Nature-based coastal protection in Tunisia (ORIENTATE-TN)",
  "sdo:name": "Oceanographic and Ecological data for Nature-based coastal protection in Tunisia (ORIENTATE-TN)",
  "sdo:description": "The overall objective is to provide sustainable, cost-effective data and an ecologically sound alternative to facilitate the adaptive governance of erosion risk in Tunisia’s most vulnerable coastal areas. The project will be carried out through a living lab approach involves cost-effective intertidal seagrass transplantation. Pilot sites will be used to monitor if this Nature-based solution approach could protect the coastline against further erosion processes. This project aims to  serve as a blueprint for other beaches and coastal areas in Tunisia.",
